          "initialMessage": {
            "title": "Instructions:",
            "content": "<p align = \"justify\">This tool enables users to provide georeferenced data and related technical information for new offshore wind project proposals. <br>To <b>add a project</b>, please zoom in and select the approximate location on the map. The system will automatically capture the coordinates and redirect you to a submission form, which must be completed to finalize the process. You will automatically see on the map the projects which are already available in the database.<br> All submitted data will undergo review before being integrated into the WebGIS and reflected on the map.<br>Contributions are welcome from across Europe, not only from Marinewind partners.</p>",
